# Platform Customer Status & Provisioning Consistency

- Trial badges require authoritative subscription `trialing` or an active trial window — never `customers.status = trial` alone.
- Agreement duration (`lifetime` → Unlimited) is separate from agreement status (`active`).
- Do not show raw seeded plan names like `Unonight Lifetime` in customer UI; use localized agreement display mapping.
- License setup status is derived from `domain_reference` + linked installation — not array lengths alone.
- Hide create-license / add-domain-installation when the customer already has the configured license chain; offer view-only alternatives.
- `metadata.generatedAt` is response generation time → label as last checked, not last updated.
- Never activate Website Kompis from status/provisioning consistency work.
